{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/quickstart/index.html","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-28T00:59:33.604254Z","id":"a0eaca19ae9a378c7fb3a96a44cd5b6252b5a456a612196691bf170a7788cbe9","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:124dadc40","summary":"Fixed in 124dadc40: the build drops the tab bar from the shipped index.html (TABS in web/scripts/build-quickstart.mjs) and the page loads and links ideas only when the tab exists (IDEAS_PAGE in index.html); build-quickstart.test.ts 'drops the tab bar from the shipped index.html' and 'the real index.html has one tab bar, which the build drops whole' pass in //web:unit.","supersedes":"feb974f6cf3a670a9529af5bce78f9e153e95f69ed0f1d8f4bfb4fe796c904ac","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e18aa7d7-bdd7-42c6-a52e-16a9153256f7"]}}
